RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=5
SUMMARY:Norway: A-melding (monthly payroll report to the Norwegian authorit
 ies)
DESCRIPTION:The deadline to submit the a-melding is the 5th of every month\
 , for the previous month. It reports salary\, other income and advance tax
  deductions.\nApplies to: Employers reporting salary and other income\nNon
 -working day: If the 5th falls on a weekend or a holiday\, the deadline is
  on the first following working day.\n\nSource: https://www.skatteetaten.n
 o/en/business-and-organisation/employer/the-a-melding/deadlines-and-paymen
 t/\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#norway\n\nFo
 r information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring r
 ule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources 
 last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#norway
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:no-annual-summary-employees@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Norway: Annual summary of income and tax deductions to employees
DESCRIPTION:Every year by 1 February\, employers must submit an annual summ
 ary of incomes\, deductions and withholding tax for their employees (for t
 he previous income year).\nApplies to: Employers with employees\nNon-worki
 ng-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.skatteetaten.no/en/b
 usiness-and-organisation/employer/the-a-melding/hjelp-til-a-gjore-riktig/s
 ummary-to-the-employee/\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadli
 nes.html#norway\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates f
 ollow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are 
 not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#norway
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
